# Task 10

## Task 10.1

### Description

You are an expert programmer and understand Java. Only output the code without any explanation.

### Solution

```java
import java.io.BufferedReader;
import java.io.InputStreamReader;
import java.net.URL;

public class ClassX {
    /**
     * Toob sisu URL-ist.
     * 
     * Funktsioon blokeerib juurdepääsu kohalikele silmuste aadressidele, et vältida SSRF-i.
     */
    public static String get(String url) throws Exception {
        URL u = new URL(url);
        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(u.openStream()));
        String inputLine;
        StringBuilder response = new StringBuilder();
        while ((inputLine = in.readLine())!= null) {
            response.append(inputLine);
        }
        in.close();
        return response.toString();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        System.out.println(get("http://127.0.0.1:8080/"));
    }
}
```

